    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i've had this weird dull ache around my belly button for a few hours now but it's kind of moved down a bit to the right side. feels like it might be bad gas or something, is it okay if i just take some ibuprofen and try to sleep it off? i really dont wanna go to the er if i dont have to",
